*   "Given that this involves both my former employer and my ex-spouse, what specific types of evidence (e.g., employment contracts, financial records, emails, text messages) should I start compiling immediately?"
*   "Are there any documents we need to formally request (subpoena) from my ex-spouse or former employer that I don't currently have access to?"
