*   "What is our primary goal for the preliminary hearing?"
*   "What is the standard of proof required at this stage, and do we currently have enough evidence to meet it?"
*   "Are there any specific actions I should avoid taking right now (e.g., communicating with my ex-spouse or former employer) to protect our case?"

