*   What exactly is the purpose of this specific preliminary hearing in Maricopa County Civil Court? 
*   Will I be required to speak or testify at this hearing, or will you be doing all the talking?
*   If I do have to speak, what kinds of questions should I be prepared to answer?
*   What are the possible outcomes of this preliminary hearing? (e.g., could the case be dismissed, or is it strictly scheduling/procedural?)

### 4. Strategy & Communication
*   What is our overall legal strategy going into this case?
*   What is the best way to reach you if I remember a crucial detail or find a new piece of evidence?
*   Are there any specific actions I should absolutely avoid doing right now? (e.g., contacting the ex-spouse, posting on social media, talking to former coworkers).

